%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: SandroIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Sorry, I was watching the light hit the roof opposite. The ash gives
      it an amber quality. Here, my documents. Sandro Kakhidze, mechanic on the
      south row.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: The work's changed a bit. People bring me things they can't afford
      to replace, asking me to keep them running. I don't always have the parts.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Does that frustrate you?
      npcResponse: Sometimes. But there's something hopeful about fixing a thing
        that shouldn't work anymore. I know that sounds strange right now.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    - playerChoiceText: Busy workshop?
      npcResponse: It comes and goes. People either bring everything in or stop
        coming entirely. Not much in between lately.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I live with my partner, Irakli. Six years now. He works nights so
      we don't overlap much. I left a book on a bench this morning. Do you ever
      feel like you're reading the same chapter twice?
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: Same papers, different faces. Or the other way around. My papers,
      October expiry, I believe. Yes, October. Thank you.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: I know what you mean.
      npcResponse: Right. You see it in this booth. There's a poem in it somewhere.
        I just haven't found the last line.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    - playerChoiceText: That's a poetic way to put it.
      npcResponse: My partner says I make everything a poem. He's not wrong.
        Occupational habit.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
